 {id:'T08',phase:2,field:'needs.travel',question:'Will you need routine care away from home?',why:'Routine care away from home can have different coverage limits from emergency care. Tell us where you expect to need routine care.',teach:'Travel needs become a check on the exact coverage. Do not assume that emergency coverage means routine care is covered.',multi:true,options:[['local','Local only'],['another_state','Another state'],['outside_us','Outside the US'],['unknown','Not sure']],writes:['needs.travel']},
 {id:'T09',phase:3,field:'needs.costPreference',question:'How would you prefer to balance monthly payments and costs when you get care?',why:'This helps us explain the tradeoffs you care about. It is not enough by itself to choose a coverage route or calculate your total costs.',teach:'Premiums are monthly payments. Deductibles, copays and coinsurance are costs when you get care. Medigap can help with certain Original Medicare costs; it does not pair with Medicare Advantage.',options:[['lower_monthly','Lower monthly payments'],['predictable','More predictable costs'],['no_preference','No preference yet']],writes:['needs.costPreference']},
